WEBVTT

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:41.710
We've confirmed the unnatural increase in spiritual energy.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:45.670
We believe Amakusa Shirou's revival is happening inside the cocoon.

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:47.630
I repeat, we've confirmed...

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:55.270
I guess we can't climb out of here.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.940
L-Leave me here...

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.110
Silence, you can't order me arou-

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:17.410
Shit, shit, shit!

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:18.790
Shit shit shit!

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:19.920
SHIT!

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:23.290
Leave you?

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:25.760
I'm not going to follow your orders!

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:29.930
Say something, Nia! You're my samurai!

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:32.760
Shut up and follow the general's orders!

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:33.850
Wake up, Nia!

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:35.010
The Goodbye Kiss
Wake up, Nia!

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:38.020
NIA!
The Goodbye Kiss

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:45.440
The Goodbye Kiss

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:54.120
There should have been scary things and sad things along the way,

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:57.660
yet I can only remember the fun things.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.750
<i>Listen, Jyuubei.</i>

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:07.420
<i>Next time we make a contract with Muneakira, your personality will cease to exist within me.</i>

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:09.840
Though it's unavoidable.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:14.640
You're the only one who can save Great Japan from this crisis.

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:18.680
But it's still difficult.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.560
I'm scared.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.230
I don't want to disappear...

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:25.610
Jyuubei.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:26.650
Jyuubei?

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:27.570
Jyuubei!

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:29.440
Are you all right?

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.360
What's wrong, Jyuubei?

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.410
It's nothing.

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.320
Anyway, let's kiss already!

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:38.660
This place is going to collapse if we don't hurry.

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.620
S-Sure.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.790
We don't have a moment to waste.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:44.420
Muneakira, hurry.

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.590
Yeah.

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:52.930
Onii-chan, I wonder why Jyuubei was born into this world?

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:58.220
If I'm going to disappear anyway, I'd rather not have any fun memories.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:00.930
I wouldn't want to be born in the first place.

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:03.190
No!

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:04.060
Jyuubei?

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:04.980
What are you doing?

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:10.780
It's kind of embarrassing when people are watching.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:14.660
Besides, I feel bad for Yukki and Senhime-san.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.120
What a dummy.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:20.040
I don't know why myself, but I feel that it's fine if you do it.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.040
Ditto.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.500
Yukki, Senhime-san.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:29.500
Well, if you're embarrassed because we're here, we'll be waiting above.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.130
Let's rendezvous later.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:32.760
Jyuubei.

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.680
It'll be a tough fight.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:41.890
I don't know what might happen later, so let me tell you this while you're not a master samurai.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.060
Thank you. It was a lot of fun.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:47.230
Let's meet again at Yagyuu Dojo.

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:48.610
Onii-chan...

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:54.320
It was a short while, but I'm glad that I could spend time with all of you.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.740
I'm glad I was born in this world.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:00.620
Jyuubei?

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.830
Onii-chan, bye-bye.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:11.710
Yagyuu Gisen

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.340
Amakusa Shirou

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:17.510
Revival Ceremony

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:21.470
It's not enough.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:24.140
My service alone isn't enough.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:25.810
Jyuubei.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:28.400
We need Jyuubei Onee-sama's energy.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:32.940
Yes, and the energy of the students.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:39.700
If we're around, we can protect the students no matter what.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:45.250
Yukimura-sama and Senhime-sama left us here because that's what they believed.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.830
We can't act cowardly now.

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:51.710
Don't you mean they left us with the supporting role?

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:55.420
That's why you should've made your contracts at the dojo.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:56.880
Really now?

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:02.760
Even if we made the contract, I don't think we would've become master samurai.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:08.850
We do respect and believe in Muneakira-san.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:14.440
But Ohii-sama, Yukimura-san, and Jyuubei-san are beyond comparison.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.280
<b>Communicating
Tokugawa Sen
Hanzou, can you hear me?</b>

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.740
Yes, Ohii-sama.
<b>Tokugawa Sen
Communicating</b>

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.490
We reached the rendezvous point.
<b>Tokugawa Sen
Communicating</b>

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:29.710
Fine! Now that it's come to this, we're going to execute the <i>perfect</i> defense!

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.590
Hanzou-san, Matabei-san, are you ready?

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:35.380
Yes.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:38.590
Seems like Team Love Warriors has been established once again.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:41.510
It sounds like you'll be just fine.

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:43.010
Yes, leave it to us.

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:46.100
Thank you. I believe in you.

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.430
Ohii-sama...

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:53.650
No matter how far I may be, my heart is with you.

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:55.270
I know.

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.650
Matabei, Kanetsugu.

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:59.320
Don't you dare die.

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.820
This is an order, got it?

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:02.570
Yes.

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:07.120
I'll follow your orders just this once.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:11.790
Senhime-sama, please tell Yukimura-sama...

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.830
Good luck.

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.210
Roger that.

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.050
I'm sorry.

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:25.970
I can only go this far with you.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:29.230
Worry about yourself before us.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:32.350
This place isn't safe either.

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:33.560
Precisely.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:36.730
But you came for us.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:40.490
You came to see through your samurai's fight.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:44.030
I'm happy to have you as my general.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.740
Thank you, Muneakira.

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:50.830
You should make the contract once more.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.750
You have awakened as a true general.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:08:00.760
If you kiss them again, you will form an even stronger bond than before.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:07.100
It will be so strong, you'd be able to feel their warmth with your own body, no matter how separated you become.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.510
Warmth...

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.220
With your own body?

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.180
Are you going to do it?

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.650
You go first.

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:20.990
Then I'll go!

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:24.110
Hold on there.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:28.910
Jyuubei.

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:37.290
These feelings you left within me are beyond my comprehension.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:40.050
But I don't need to understand them.

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:43.590
I'll just leave them in my heart.

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:49.930
It's a sign of respect for the imperfect ones who allowed Muneakira to awaken as a true general...

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:56.190
And a sign of respect for you, you who were able to spend your last moments smiling.

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:03.820
I wasn't wrong in thinking you would become the ultimate general.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:07.660
You were the first one to accept me as a general.

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:09.950
Thank you, Yukimura.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:16.670
I was the one who had an eye on you since we were kids.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.830
Make sure you don't forget that.

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:20.710
I won't.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:24.220
I've never forgotten it, not even once, Senhime-sama.

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:27.800
Sanada Yukimura
True Contract

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:29.930
Muneakira...

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:31.310
Tokugawa Sen
True Contract

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:33.390
Muneakira...

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.480
I love you.

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:41.070
I love you!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:52.990
Amazing, I can feel the power!

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:56.290
So this is the power of a true master samurai.

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:59.420
It seems like they've noticed us, my general.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:00.750
Your orders.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:06.630
The enemy may not be prepared, but they're strong enough to have defeated seven master samurai.

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:10.300
However, we will never retreat!

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:13.220
Great Japan's future rests on this battle.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.220
Believe in the will of the Heavens!

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:17.140
All troops, charge!

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:21.150
Yukimura, open a path!

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.900
Good, focus on what's in front of you!

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:35.120
Jyuubei, behind you!

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:39.250
Vacuum Blast!

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:43.340
Nice!

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.210
Watch out, Yukimura!

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:48.380
Senhime-sama, follow up!

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:54.390
Keep going!

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:58.100
Lightning Fang

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:10.030
Go through!

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:15.870
Yukimura!

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.040
Help Jyuubei!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:17.950
Affirmative!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.210
Use the wind!

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:27.210
GO!

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.900
I'm counting on you, Jyuubei.

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:45.230
Jyuubei

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:47.520
Gisen

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:53.610
Onee-sama, you took the effort to come here yourself?

00:11:55.570 --> 00:12:00.910
To ease Shirou-sama's injuries, we need two great samurai serving him.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:05.420
That's why he revived us: to allow his return.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:09.050
But you made a contract with that boring man.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:12.720
I need to take back Onee-sama.

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:16.550
I tried my best to drop Yagyuu Muneakira into the darkness.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:20.600
It was all for Shirou-sama's sake.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:24.190
Then why did you create your castle here?

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:30.780
If you didn't let me through the barrier, you wouldn't have put Amakusa in danger.

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:35.990
That's to devour you, Onee-sama!

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:41.080
I'll devour your flesh, bones, blood, everything and become one with you!

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:45.420
Then I will be the only one needed to serve Shirou-sama!

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:49.590
Fool, you think you can devour me so easily?

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:51.210
I'll devour you.

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:58.510
After all, the more I loath everyone: Muneakira, and those other samurai, the more power I gain!

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:00.390
What?

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.270
Crescent!

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.860
It's execution time.

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:14.450
Sanada Yukimura

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:15.860
Yukimura!

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:16.780
Tokugawa Sen

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:18.200
Senhime-sama!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.120
Yagyuu Muneakira

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:23.580
I can feel their spirits; they're still alive!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.290
But...

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:29.790
Naoe Kanetsugu

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:33.510
Gotou Matabei

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:35.300
Hattori Hanzou

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:39.180
We slice and dice, but they just keep coming!

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.640
There's no end to them.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.890
We're at our limit.

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:44.850
Ohii-sama, please respond!

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:47.310
Please respond, Ohii-sama!

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:50.810
Matabei-san, Kanetsugu-san!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:10.750
What's wrong, Onee-sama?

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:21.640
How does it feel? Getting your energy sucked out.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:26.560
It seems like there's an impurity inside.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:32.650
You're so worried about those you left outside.

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:36.780
So you can't concentrate on fighting me.

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:37.990
That's how it is.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:46.160
I win, I win!

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:47.700
I've won!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:51.080
Shirou-sama, I give this victory to you!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:55.380
Please awaken and reward me!

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.800
Wh-What the hell is going on?!

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:13.310
They seem to have weakened all of a sudden.

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:14.060
Yes.

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.860
Ow ow ow ow...

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:18.530
What's happening?

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:20.610
Hanzou-san, how are things above ground?

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:21.780
Just a second.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.620
Th-This is...!

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:27.040
We have reinforcements!

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:30.460
Reinforcements have broken the barrier and gotten into the academy!

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:32.880
Tokugawa Yoshihiko's samurai?

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:34.880
Whatever.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:38.510
The students' energy is just the frosting.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.430
In the end all we need is my and Onee-sama's energy.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:46.350
Shirou-sama, we're almost there. Please wait just a little more.

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.980
What's going on? What happened all of a sudden?

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:52.350
This is...

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:54.650
Are you unharmed, Yagyuu Muneakira?

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.820
Yukimura! Senhime-sama!

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:01.450
Calm down. They're just unconscious.

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:03.360
Were you all right?

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:03.990
No.

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:06.200
I died once.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:09.870
I died and came back to life.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.590
I made a contract with a true general.

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:24.180
Then Yoshihiko-sama has...

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:27.220
Sadly enough, I'm fine.

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:30.220
Can you hear me, Yagyuu Muneakira?

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.180
Yes!

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:35.150
I'll temporarily lend you a hand to stop Amakusa's return.

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:39.690
I must emphasize that this is only to protect Great Japan.

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:42.320
I haven't accepted you yet.

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:46.030
Yes, I'll pretend that's how it is, Yoshihiko-sama!

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:51.790
They still had that much power?

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:53.580
What are you doing, Muneakira?

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.420
Leave this to me.

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:57.000
Give your samurai your strength!

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:59.670
Jyuubei is waiting for you.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:00.550
Yes!

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:02.420
We'll finish them off, Nia!

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:03.590
Roger.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.760
Jyuubei, can you hear me?

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.390
Jyuubei.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:11.350
Jyuubei!

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:14.430
Wake up.

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:16.650
Jyuubei-san.

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.770
Jyuubei-san, wake up.

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.780
Onii-chan's calling.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:25.610
Jyuubei...?

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.320
Why are you here?

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:30.330
Onii-chan called me back.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.120
Listen carefully.

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.660
You can hear Onii-chan's voice, can't you?

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:39.130
I'm sorry, but I'm...

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.750
Don't be scared, Jyuubei-san.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:45.800
Somebody might die in this battle.

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:48.720
Kind of like how I disappeared.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:52.890
But remember, feelings are eternal. They never disappear.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:54.730
See?

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:57.940
You can hear Onii-chan's voice.

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:01.650
You can hear Onii-chan's feelings.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:03.610
Jyuubei.

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:06.240
Please, wake up.

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:07.110
Jyuubei.

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:09.780
JYUUBEI!

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.080
What?

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.420
O-Onee-sama?

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:24.550
N-No, wait...

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:25.050
Who are you?

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:26.840
Who are you?!

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.680
Yagyuu Jyuubei.

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:32.350
But don't think I'm the same as before.

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:36.850
Thanks to my true general, both Yagyuu Jyuubeis have been reborn.

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:41.190
The power of hate has no effect on us!

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:44.230
I'll slice you!

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:49.910
What's happened?

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.740
Sen, are you all right?

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:55.830
Muneakira.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:56.870
Jyuubei.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.250
GO!

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:03.380
Jyuubei!

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.670
Gisen!

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.680
I hate you, I hate you, I hate you!

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:21.190
You two, I found the exit!

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:22.060
Come on!

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:24.610
What's going on?

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:30.610
Yoshihiko, we should join in!

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:33.490
No, we can't.

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:37.200
I hate to say it, but they're on a whole new level.

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:40.290
We have to let Muneakira handle it.

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:42.870
Jyuubei! Do it!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.420
Sh-She's strong.

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:52.510
This is what a true master samurai is like...?

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:03.520
Shirou-sama, Shirou-sama!

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:08.820
Please give me the power of the general!

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.240
Is it Amakusa?

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:19.450
What was it your power comes from?

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:23.460
A bond? I'll slice it to pieces!

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:25.630
Shoot! Muneakira!

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.800
Muneakira!

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:34.260
Get back!

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:39.680
Wow, something amazing is happening!

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:42.520
It's dangerous, please get down!

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:57.200
There's no need to worry!

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:01.330
You're not going to call me a burden anymore!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.120
You were about to become one.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:03.580
Yup.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:11.130
Jyuubei, use your true power!

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.550
Show her what it's all about!

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:16.220
Damn you all...

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:19.640
I'll never forgive you!

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:22.640
Muneakira, take these feelings...

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:24.350
And give them to Jyuubei!

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:25.730
Jyuubei,

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:30.940
receive our feelings!

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:32.860
Stop!

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:40.830
What?

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:45.870
You weaklings!

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:48.790
Unrivaled Supernatural Power!

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:53.210
I'll protect this country!

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:56.550
Our home!

00:21:57.050 --> 00:21:58.510
Since we promised.

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:01.430
Promised to meet at Yagyuu Dojo again.

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:07.690
But I'm sorry, Onii-chan. I don't think I can keep that promise.

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:14.570
What?!

00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:19.700
This isn't good!

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:23.030
Unleashing any more energy is equivalent to suicide!

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:24.450
What?!

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:26.200
Make her stop, Muneakira!

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:28.120
Stop, Jyuubei...

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:29.420
STOP!

00:22:30.420 --> 00:22:32.340
Goodbye, Onii-chan...

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:41.220
I-I'm being pushed back?

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:42.180
Why?!

00:22:42.180 --> 00:22:43.640
You still don't get it?

00:22:44.060 --> 00:22:47.430
If you don't, you can't beat me!

00:22:50.190 --> 00:22:52.110
I-It burns!

00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:54.570
Let go, let me go!

00:22:54.570 --> 00:22:57.400
You're also going to die at this rate!

00:22:58.150 --> 00:23:00.320
So you meant to die from the start?

00:23:00.320 --> 00:23:06.120
Fine, but in one hundred, maybe one thousand years, I'll return!

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:08.660
Yes, that's when-

00:23:08.660 --> 00:23:13.290
That's when another general and samurai of Great Japan shall face you!

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:15.380
What's there to fear?

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:18.380
As long as there are generals and samurai in this country...

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:20.840
As long as there is trust and bonding in this country!

00:23:31.770 --> 00:23:33.230
Jyuubei's presence disappeared.

00:23:33.230 --> 00:23:34.110
Did she...?

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:35.150
No way!

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:36.980
Jyuubei...

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:39.860
JYUUBEI!

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:45.030
I can hear everyone's voices.

00:23:46.030 --> 00:23:47.450
I'm so happy.

00:23:49.120 --> 00:23:51.040
One Week Later
The battle has ended.

00:23:51.670 --> 00:23:55.250
But Buou Academy School's recovery is far off...

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:59.460
And Amakusa's whereabouts are unknown.

00:23:59.840 --> 00:24:04.180
Perhaps nothing has ended.

00:24:04.890 --> 00:24:07.850
But I still believe...

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:11.350
That some day, most definitely, our bonds,

00:24:12.270 --> 00:24:17.360
our trust will heal the damage done to this city.

00:24:18.780 --> 00:24:19.570
No matter what.
